# ==============================================================================
# DALEK CANN SUPREME CODE EVOLUTION SYSTEM - MASTER GITIGNORE
# ==============================================================================
# This .gitignore file is the primary security perimeter for the DARLEK_CAAN_ENGINE.
# It prevents the leakage of sensitive credentials, agentic memory states, and
# build-time artifacts into the repository, ensuring a clean, deterministic state.
#
# Architectural Siphon Context:
# - Next.js/Vercel: Build/Cache optimization.
# - Microsoft/Playwright: Test/Automation isolation.
# - Unitary-Core/SN: Agentic memory/Vector store isolation.
# - Sovereign-Kernel: Self-refactoring workspace protection.
# ==============================================================================

